plasm_expr	Meaning
v9	ref:Document · Document slug or id this API uses
v6	markdown
v7	str · Short text
v4	json · JSON object
v2	bool · true/false flag (for example resolve thread)
v8	uuid · Optional idempotency key so you can retry the same edit batch safely
v3	int · Integer
Block	Block
CollaborationEvent	CollaborationEvent
operations	json · json · operations
links	SDK link bundle (state, ops, docs). Wire key _links
agent_auth	Auth hints from share JSON agent.auth (token source, header names)
report	Full bug report
r1	blocks · Blocks from the latest snapshot—use for edits that need stable block ids
r2	collaboration_events · Recent collaboration updates you have not acknowledged yet
v210{mark_id=$,text=$,resolve=$}	→ comment_reply — Reply in a thread; optionally resolve in the same step
v211{mark_id=$}	→ comment_resolve — Resolve a thread; keep history
v212{mark_id=$}	→ comment_unresolve — Unresolve a thread for more replies
v101{ref=$,markdown=$}	→ replace_block — Replace one block’s markdown
v102{ref=$,blocks=$}	→ insert_before — Insert blocks before the anchor block
v103{ref=$,blocks=$}	→ insert_after — Insert blocks after the anchor block
v104{ref=$}	→ delete_block — Delete one block
v105{fromRef=$,toRef=$,blocks=$}	→ replace_range — Replace a range of blocks with new blocks
v106{ref=$,find=$,replace=$,occurrence=$}	→ find_replace_in_block — Find and replace text inside one block
v107{find=$,replace=$,occurrence=$,fromRef=$,toRef=$,blockFilter=$}	→ find_replace_in_doc — Find and replace text across the document (optional block range or kind filter)
v10	union · v210 | v211 | v212
v11	union · v101 | v102 | v103 | v104 | v105 | v106 | v107
